+ * Architectural notes:
+ *  - The orchestration entry-point, the indirect low-level wrapper, the
+ *    seven sub-init helpers, and the inline MMIO accessors are all
+ *    composite-module-internal per AS-003 and intentionally NOT exposed
+ *    here. Files that need them reach the symbols via file-scope extern
+ *    declarations across translation-unit boundaries.
+ *  - The atomic ordering-guard variable lives in the matching .c file with
+ *    EXTERNAL linkage so other TUs in the composite can flip it via extern.
+ *    It is composite-module-internal — not exposed here.
+ *  - GSWIP-3.0 / GRX350 only. GSWIP-3.1 / GRX550 register layouts diverge in
